BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (The system separates simulation, risk estimation, route selection, and evaluation. The simulator produces noisy delay,) Tj T* (loss, queue, utilization, and link-up observations while link health remains hidden. A predictor consumes a rolling) Tj T* (telemetry window and estimates link risk for a selected horizon. The routing agent combines those estimates with) Tj T* (current path measurements and selects one route from a fixed candidate set. A shared rollout and metrics pipeline) Tj T* (evaluates heuristic and learned policies on matched seeds.) Tj T* ET
